    "Supply interpreted Separation and Replacement for arbitrary internal/nonstandard matrix and parameter codes. Standard semantic completeness and D1 at each externally chosen formula do not discharge this uniform schema obligation.",
    "Assemble all hAx branches with Good and provable_domain in provable_falsum_of_interp. R2 native-proof-to-CProv and the arithmetic/binary interpreter comparison remain separate.",
    "The freshly checked NativeWFClosedParameters.parameter is a separately named closed parameter. NativeFixed uses NativeInterp.PN. Their equality and the translation/closure identity required to reuse this nonemptiness theorem for the checked parameter have not been proved in these units."
